{"surface": "event", "title": "The US-China trade truce lapses on January 10, 2027", "html": "<div class=\"ev ws\"><div class=\"evh\"><h2 class=\"title\">The US-China trade truce lapses on January 10, 2027</h2><p class=\"facts\"><span>The decision on Jan 10, 2027</span><span class=\"sep\">·</span><span class=\"src\">Known from White House; USTR; China&#x27;s Ministry of Commerce; Reuters; AP</span></p><div class=\"hds\"><details class=\"hd\" data-k=\"definition\"><summary>Definition</summary><div class=\"hdb text\"><p>The United States and China do not agree or announce a further extension of the Busan trade truce before January 11, 2027, so China&#x27;s suspended additional 24% tariff on US goods and the suspended US port fees on China-linked ships come back into force. Beijing has threatened countermeasures to the new US rule on overseas access to AI chips.</p></div></details></div></div><div class=\"strip\" data-count=\"6\" style=\"--cols:5\"><div class=\"sf first\" data-k=\"fig:Forecast\"><span class=\"lab\">Forecast</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:p:prop:21\"><span class=\"n v\">20.0%</span></a></span><a class=\"cap go calc\" data-go=\"x:p:prop:21\">How it’s set →</a></div><div class=\"sf\" data-k=\"fig:Market range\"><span class=\"lab\">Market range</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:interval:prop:21\"><span class=\"n v\">15.0%–25.0%</span></a></span></div><div class=\"sf\" data-k=\"fig:If Yes\"><span class=\"lab\">If Yes</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:outcome:prop:21:yes\"><span class=\"n v loss\">−$11,831</span></a></span><span class=\"cap\"><span class=\"n loss\">−2.35%</span> of portfolio</span></div><div class=\"sf\" data-k=\"fig:If No\"><span class=\"lab\">If No</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:outcome:prop:21:no\"><span class=\"n v gain\">+$2,958</span></a></span></div><div class=\"sf\" data-k=\"fig:Full impact\"><span class=\"lab\">Full impact</span><span class